---
import { ExternalLink, Github } from "lucide-astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How PerkCommons works"
  description="How PerkCommons reviews, publishes, and maintains open opportunity data."
>
  <section class="container py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand">How it works</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold">
      A public index with a visible editorial trail.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted">
      PerkCommons makes credible opportunities easier to discover while
      keeping the data portable, reviewable, and free. It is an open-source
      project operated by Cod from Poland.
    </p>

    <ol class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-5">
      {[
        "Submit",
        "Screen",
        "Review",
        "Publish",
        "Maintain",
      ].map((step, index) => (
        <li class="bg-surface p-5">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand">0{index + 1}</span>
          <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">{step}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What review means</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted">
          A moderator identifies a credible source, checks that material
          eligibility is described, and confirms that the destination appears
          legitimate. Records are reviewed by hand, and moderators can correct
          or remove a record when the information is inaccurate, expired,
          unsafe, or unsuitable.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
          A dated source check is not a guarantee. Eligibility, availability,
          deadlines, and final terms remain controlled by the provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Editorial independence</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted">
          Ordinary listings are not paid, sponsored, or affiliate placements.
          Payment never purchases factual approval, verification, ranking, or
          removal of a competitor.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">
          The project is currently self-funded by Cod. The only direct project
          expense paid so far has been the perkcommons.com domain registration.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16 border-t border-line pt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Open development</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-muted">
        The Next development version is built in Cod's personal GitHub forks.
        The original PerkCommons repositories remain available through the
        official PerkCommons organization.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3 font-medium no-underline"
          href="https://github.com/CodWasTaken/site"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          <Github size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Next development source
        </a>
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3 font-medium no-underline"
          href="https://github.com/PerkCommons"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          <Github size={18} aria-hidden="true" /> Original organization
        </a>
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-action px-4 py-3 font-medium text-white no-underline"
          href="/trust/"
        >
          Trust and transparency <ExternalLink size={17} aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
